{"game": "space-marine-2", "language": "english", "appid": 2183900, "month": "2025-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1756684800, "end_date": 1757289599, "month_true_total": 2426, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-09-11 02:22:15 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "203838803", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032184761", "personaname": "bidzapfc", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bidzapfc/", "num_games_owned": 199, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 16180, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11135, "last_played": 1786282187, "avatar": "19fdfee1403cbcca80eb92f0a949cd8bf0577a20"}, "language": "english", "review": "I had made friends in Oman, Germany, Croatia, and USA on this game. I called them all brother. I had to type that one line in my steam chat, and we would all be together in less than a minute, killing heretics and xenos in the name of the Emperor. This is a true masterpiece", "timestamp_created": 1757289372, "timestamp_updated": 1757289372, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "203837867", "author": {"steamid": "76561199050459182", "personaname": "TedBunddyy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199050459182/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2474, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2474, "last_played": 1755651232, "avatar": "235e6e10cd66af9a6c42020f8053cf3a32508522"}, "language": "english", "review": "unethical to recommend this when helldivers 2 exists.", "timestamp_created": 1757288231, "timestamp_updated": 1757288231, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.336546927690505981", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "203837356", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995287262", "personaname": "TheExarch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995287262/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 18394, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15395, "last_played": 1785985127, "avatar": "f7b6b9b6ec0898d936628aed176cc6861218c9a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's good", "timestamp_created": 1757287584, "timestamp_updated": 1757287584, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203837102", "author": {"steamid": "76561199061893308", "personaname": "callmeolivia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199061893308/", "num_games_owned": 111, "num_reviews": 97, "playtime_forever": 5612, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 312, "last_played": 1784052354, "avatar": "be48f7c6a52831cd2304c832824b9677e9c9615a"}, "language": "english", "review": "its alright", "timestamp_created": 1757287263, "timestamp_updated": 1757287263, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203836847", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019151196", "personaname": "Pilesformiles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198019151196/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 117, "playtime_forever": 58, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 58, "last_played": 1757285053, "avatar": "023540d4c48fe0990dc910cd86a5b45f071830cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "The fact this game has positive reviews overall pretty much sums up how easy it is to please the average warhammer fanboy. Ten years ago this may have been a decent game, but it's very clunky and slow. It's like gears of war with stripped down mechanics. Combat just doesn't feel good even when parrying and using all the given mechanics properly. You can't even climb in this game, like wtf is this crap. I don't need to scale massive walls, but at least let me hop over a 2 foot ledge so I don't have to walk my refrigerator ass all the way to the stairs. It's like a blend of gun-play and sword-play that just doesn't feel good because of how stripped down everything is. I'd rather have a heavy focus on guns or melee, then sprinkle the other one in. This just feels like a hodge-podge of half-assed mechanics. They tried to emphasize melee combat, but it took too much away from ranged combat. It creates an odd back and forth where you have to use both forms of combat in order to succeed, even if it's not the most viable option at the moment. It sounds like it would create a more fluid form of combat, but it just turns into a jumbled mess of you trying to do too many things at once, ironically giving the exact opposite experience.", "timestamp_created": 1757286940, "timestamp_updated": 1757286940, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.464896529912948608", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203836291", "author": {"steamid": "76561198154578324", "personaname": "b.kaskir", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198154578324/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 863, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 277, "last_played": 1757863214, "avatar": "8c14c031614cb3c30444ffbec7b65d26d19293b8"}, "language": "english", "review": "awesome", "timestamp_created": 1757286295, "timestamp_updated": 1757286295, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203835863", "author": {"steamid": "76561199003837308", "personaname": "quickscope2145", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199003837308/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 7560, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 153, "playtime_at_review": 2615, "last_played": 1789068404, "avatar": "647606226544ded346e42a776d30f76a0c4ad068"}, "language": "english", "review": "FOR THE IMPERIUM OF MAN AT THE EMPERORS COMMAND!", "timestamp_created": 1757285810, "timestamp_updated": 1757285810, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203835854", "author": {"steamid": "76561199392771577", "personaname": "Andrzej", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199392771577/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4804, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "pl